WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
You think of me as a monster again

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,200
I'll take away your gold river too

3
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,540
But this time I am rich again

4
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,820
The person who was killed by Xiaohui hasn’t got the gold river yet.

5
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,340
A total of seven red gold rivers

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:14,900
This time I will definitely fall into a deep sleep

7
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,380
The last deep sleep lasted three days

8
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,900
It’s not sure how long this sleep will last.

9
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,180
I need a strong escort

10
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,860
And Shen Mengting is very suitable

11
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:22,900
Her telepathy is almost the most powerful telepathy I have ever seen.

12
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,300
With a soul contract, you can let her protect you with peace of mind

13
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,420
Wait until you wake up

14
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,140
Then consider whether to eat her golden river

15
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,140
After reading her secret

16
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,140
Feeling a little sick

17
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:31,580
What did you say?

18
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,300
Still alive next time

19
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,500
But rebelled

20
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:37,770
How could the next Qing betray the base?

21
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:39,940
yes chief

22
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,340
I tried to release her from mind control

23
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:43,740
but nothing happens

24
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,140
She should have done it spontaneously
